I unlock the door.
I am finally home in my apartment.
It is wet and windy outside.
But it is warm in here.
My winter jacket is very wet.
I take the jacket off.
My umbrella also drips with water.
I walk out into the bathroom.
I put the umbrella on the floor.
The water drips down onto the tiles.
Then I walk into the living room.
It is completely dark in here.
I can barely see anything.
There is a small lamp in the corner.
I turn on the lamp.
The light is yellow and soft.
It immediately becomes brighter in the living room.
Now the living room is warm and bright.
It is nice to be indoors now.
